#, fuzzy
msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-50559[CVE-2026-50559] - HTTP path-based authorization bypass via encoded semicolons, slashes, and backslashes"
msgstr "link:https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-50559[CVE-2026-50559] - Contorno da autorização baseada em caminho HTTP por meio de ponto-e-vírgula, barras e barras invertidas codificadas"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: _posts/2026-08-05-quarkus-3-38-1-released.adoc
#, fuzzy
